            "question": "Can I change or cancel my order?",
            "answer": "<p>We begin preparing orders as quickly as possible. If you need to make a change, please contact us immediately after placing your order. While we cannot guarantee changes once an order has entered processing, we will always do our best to assist.</p>"
          }
        },
        "g3q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship throughout Australia?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Maison Cavallé ships throughout Australia.</p>"
